                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "4/10 - Unfortunately, the levels are very confusing and the enemies are unforeseeable. They simply turn around at certain points, can see you through barriers from a great distance, or are standing right behind a door without you being able to see them before you open it. You also can't effectively peek around corners. As soon as they spot you, the enemies hunt you down throughout the entire level, and you die after just two hits. Then reload at the checkpoint and try again.",
